      "textEvidence": {
        "text": "D.D. Assailant is a Level 4 EARTH Warrior Effect Monster with 1700 ATK and 1600 DEF. After damage calculation, only when this card would be destroyed by battle with an opponent's monster, its mandatory Trigger Effect banishes both of those battling monsters. It does not activate when D.D. Assailant survives and only destroys its weaker opponent. It can apply while attacking, defending, or in mutual battle destruction; battle damage is still calculated normally. The two cards are banished to their physical owners' zones, not first placed in the Graveyard. If Skill Drain negates the effect while this card is face-up, ordinary battle destruction and Graveyard movement take place. No cost, optional choice, targeting or unrelated effect is printed. The card debuted in the OCG bundled with Expert 3 in February 2004.",
        "format": "full-rule-paraphrase",
        "complete": true,
